{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in the underground city of Blackchapel, where misery and despair reign. Fortunately, you recently found a huge drill to take you to the surface. You'll need to fuel it with a mysterious substance, which can only be obtained by recovering the bodies of monsters populating the city. Fight your way through the alleys and dark corners to set up traps and catch the monsters you need. If they try to contact you, don't respond; they can understand you.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132640/extras/14c8482343ba233b3d880ec2162f9871.avif?t=1762319052\" width=1024 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132640/extras/9add03a9995472d4092e97270af7ebec.poster.avif?t=1762319052\" width=1024 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132640/extras/9add03a9995472d4092e97270af7ebec.webm?t=1762319052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132640/extras/3d56ec394ee4dbf35a327cd681021cdf.avif?t=1762319052\" width=1024 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132640/extras/b652666f77e1566d899adf56cc177bc4.poster.avif?t=1762319052\" width=1024 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132640/extras/b652666f77e1566d899adf56cc177bc4.webm?t=1762319052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=v